        70.86609649658203,
        287.73712158203125,
        527.4990234375,
        302.1801452636719
      ],
      "text": "the degree of confidence that the estimates of effect (desirable or undesirable) are close to the actual",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989745140075684,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.9371337890625,
        527.63134765625,
        315.3801574707031
      ],
      "text": "effects of interest. The usefulness of an estimate of effect depends on the degree of confidence in that",
