      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        327.33709716796875,
        527.1224365234375,
        341.7801208496094
      ],
      "text": "can be made. WHO guideline development is based on specific criteria for assessing the characteristics",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
